In a nutshell, the answer is:

*	Yes the 36.4 GB Drives are supported in the RA3000 RAID Subsystem.
*	The 3B05 "firmware" is applicable to the drive itself, not the
controller.

I plan to download and install the latest firmware version for the RA3000
controllers (HSZ22), just cause.

Thanks to a couple of DEC TruGurus who both went out of 
their ways to help clear things up for me:

alan@nabeth
Colin Walters

It's always best to make sure of these little things BEFORE you order drives
(especially around here where
things move    s  l   o    w      l       y. )

