hyperterminal session on a DS10L

Result:
Fixed my own problem.  Unfortunately, I'm not sure how.  After dinking =
with the thing all last night, I decided to try another box.  It didn't =
work, either so I plugged the serial cable back into the original box =
and viola, everything worked.  Go figure.  For those who wonder, yes, I =
had already plugged and unplugged the serial cable several times.

Much thanks to Colin Walters and Alan Davis

