Running V5.0a on an ES40.  Have it connected to a brocade bridge.  Being
told a set of "passthrough" drivers aren't being loaded.  Was my
understanding that if support is loaded and the kernel is rebuilt, anything
driver related should be there.
Can someone comment on whether you need to "load" a driver (ala NT and say
VMS) after you boot a new kernel?

Thanks

Jim

