Louis came through with the correct answer.  I went back and only
updated the SRM and everything is correctly running now.



"Louis F. Rossi" wrote:
> 
> Hi Darryl,
> 
>   I had the same thing happen to me on my 255/233.  The key is to
> upgrade only the SRM even though the release notes say to upgrade the
> ARC.  If you choose, upgrade ROM which is supposed to do everything for
> you, it only chooses the SRM.
> 
>   Scary, eh?
> 
>   Cheers,
>     Lou
> 
